          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The right surface cleaner size is the largest deck your washer can spin at full speed. For most homeowner gas washers that means 15 to 16 inches; for most electric washers, 12 to 14. Bigger decks only pay off with genuinely high-flow machines.
          </p>
